 * Adds a session into a tunnel
 *
 * @return
 *   - LE_OK -- Success.
 *   - LE_NOT_FOUND -- Not found.
 *   - LE_BAD_PARAMETER -- Bad parameter.
 *   - LE_FAULT -- Failure.
 */
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
