 * Gets IP type of a tunnel.
 *
 *   - TAF_NET_L2TP_UNKNOWN -- Failure.
 *   - TAF_NET_L2TP_IPV4 -- IPV4.
 *   - TAF_NET_L2TP_IPV6 -- IPV6.
 */
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FUNCTION IpFamilyType GetTunnelIpType
(
    TunnelEntry tunnelEntryRef                IN ///< Tunnel entry reference.
);

